calc(55,r'r=\cos^4(\theta/4)','전체 곡선을 그려 구간을 정하고 정확한 길이를 구하라.','Graph the whole curve, choose an interval, and find its exact length.',[r'0\le\theta\le4\pi,\quad r\prime=-\cos^3(\theta/4)\sin(\theta/4)',r'\sqrt{r^2+(r\prime)^2}=|\cos^3(\theta/4)|',r'L=4\int_0^\pi|\cos^3u|\,du'],r'L=16/3')
svg(55,'Full curve over four pi',[('curve',polar(lambda t:math.cos(t/4)**4,0,4*math.pi))])
calc(56,r'r=\cos^2(\theta/2)','전체 곡선을 그려 구간을 정하고 정확한 길이를 구하라.','Graph the whole curve, choose an interval, and find its exact length.',[r'r=(1+\cos\theta)/2,\quad0\le\theta\le2\pi',r'\sqrt{r^2+(r\prime)^2}=|\cos(\theta/2)|'],r'L=\int_0^{2\pi}|\cos(\theta/2)|\,d\theta=4')
svg(56,'Cardioid with scale one half',[('curve',polar(lambda t:math.cos(t/2)**2))])
calc(57,r'r=\cos(\theta/5)','원문 파란 부분은 바깥 고리를 제외한 안쪽 경로이다. 길이 적분만 세우고 계산하지 말라.','The blue source portion is the inner trace excluding the outer loop. Set up, but do not evaluate, its length integral.',[r'\text{blue interval}:\quad\pi\le\theta\le4\pi',r'r\prime=-\frac15\sin(\theta/5)'],r'L=\int_\pi^{4\pi}\sqrt{\cos^2(\theta/5)+\frac1{25}\sin^2(\theta/5)}\,d\theta')
svg(57,'Blue inner trace',[('requested',polar(lambda t:math.cos(t/5),math.pi,4*math.pi)),('outer arc part 1',polar(lambda t:math.cos(t/5),0,math.pi)),('outer arc part 2',polar(lambda t:math.cos(t/5),4*math.pi,5*math.pi))])
calc(58,r'r=\sin\theta/\theta','원문 파란 부분은 큰 호의 양의 세로축 교점부터 시작해 원점을 지나 다음 오른쪽 작은 고리를 완주한다. 길이 적분만 세워라.','The blue portion starts where the large arc meets the positive vertical axis, passes through the pole, and completes the next small right loop. Set up its length integral only.',[r'\pi/2\le\theta\le2\pi',r'r\prime=(\theta\cos\theta-\sin\theta)/\theta^2'],r'L=\int_{\pi/2}^{2\pi}\sqrt{\left(\frac{\sin\theta}{\theta}\right)^2+\left(\frac{\theta\cos\theta-\sin\theta}{\theta^2}\right)^2}\,d\theta')
